      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">What if the work doesn't move the metric?</button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            We scope the metric upfront: daily ops hours, subscription spend, prompt eval pass rate, whatever's bleeding. If we miss the agreed target, we refund the final milestone. We've never had to.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">Do we get the code?</button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Yes. From day 1. We push to your GitHub org, not ours. You own every line, every prompt, every credential. We don't keep copies.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">Who actually does the work?</button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Anurag (founder) is on every project. Depending on scope, 1–2 engineers and a designer join. No offshore handoff, no junior overload, no agency-style staff swaps during delivery.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">Why fixed scope engagements instead of a retainer?</button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Retainers reward keeping you on retainer. Fixed scope engagements reward shipping. After delivery, you can hire us again or vanish. We'll never DM you about renewal.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">We're in healthtech / mental wellness. Can you help?</button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Sorry, no. We have an existing exclusive engagement in that space. Most other Indian D2C verticals are open.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">Do you take international clients?</button>
